          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wasesithi: Amanzi angaphansi kwezulu kawaqoqeke ndawonye, kubonakale umhlabathi owomileyo; kwaba njalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umhlabathi owomileyo uNkulunkulu wawubiza ngokuthi ngumhlaba, lamanzi aqoqeke ndawonye wawabiza ngokuthi lulwandle. UNkulunkulu wabona ukuthi kuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wasesithi: Umhlaba kawuveze utshani, lemibhida ethela inhlanyelo, lezihlahla ezithela izithelo ezilenhlanyelo yazo, ngezinhlobo zazo. Kwaba njalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umhlaba wasuveza utshani, lemibhida ethela inhlanyelo ngezinhlobo zayo, lezihlahla ezithela izithelo ezilenhlanyelo yazo, ngezinhlobo zazo. UNkulunkulu wabona ukuthi kuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaba khona ukuhlwa lokusa, kwaba lusuku lwesithathu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
